    "compose_patient": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.0",
          "heading": "why_in_hospital",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.0",
            "sections.1"
          ],
          "text": "You came in with shortness of breath, a wheeze, and green sputum that had been getting worse over 4 days. You have severe COPD, and this was a flare-up of that condition. Your breathing had become very strained, and your body was not removing carbon dioxide well enough. This is called type 2 respiratory failure."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "When you arrived, your oxygen levels were low and your breathing rate was high. We did a blood test from an artery to check your breathing.\n\nTo help you, we:\n- Gave you carefully controlled oxygen\n- Used a breathing support mask (NIV) to help your lungs\n- Gave you nebulisers to open your airways\n- Gave you a steroid (hydrocortisone, then prednisolone) to reduce inflammation\n- Gave you an antibiotic (amoxicillin) to treat infection\n\nBy day 3 you no longer needed the breathing support mask. Your oxygen levels settled back to your usual level on your home oxygen.\n\nWe also checked your inhaler technique with you, gave you a rescue pack to take home, and talked about smoking."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.2",
          "heading": "medicines",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{MEDICATIONS}}"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.3",
          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7",
            "sections.8"
          ],
          "text": "- You have a respiratory clinic appointment in 6 weeks.\n- You have been referred to the community respiratory team, who will be in touch.\n- Your GP will also review you after this flare-up."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.4",
          "heading": "safety_net",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{SAFETY_NET}}"
        }
